   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## 04 \u00b7 Video finisher\nLoad any clip, for example from 03 LTX or 05 Wan Animate.\n\n1. **SeedVR2 7B**, 2\u00d7 upscale. It restores real texture, so a 720p clip becomes 1440p. The clip is processed in auto-sized temporal chunks, so long videos fit in VRAM. Colors are matched with LAB.\n2. **RIFE 4.26 heavy**, 2\u00d7 frames: 16 fps becomes 32, or 24 becomes 48. The fps is adjusted automatically.\n3. The audio track is preserved.\n\nFaster: switch the model to *seedvr2_3b_fp16* (softer), or bypass the upscale group to interpolate only."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653",
   "title": "READ ME"
  }
